        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Berrin Onn</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/halver-onn-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Berrin Onn\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Mid-fifties vault clerk at the C&amp;V Hardby branch, and holder of one of the two vault keys. Former Aerdi treasury clerk; knows the firm's seals on sight. Deliberately incurious — he has not noticed that the &quot;special escrow&quot; Solen files in the side cabinet is unregistered, and he does not read the marginal cipher.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "BR2P3PoPgCastrianVe",
