      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Edrin Saetar</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/edrin-saetar-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Edrin Saetar\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Sculptor master in the Salters' Quarter, sixties, thin and formal. Waived Ailen Moraven's second-year tuition when her work began to sell, and keeps her on for nothing now.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
