        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Joren Krill</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/joren-krill-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Joren Krill\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Hardby weighmaster, on Cindren &amp; Vhal's payroll. Tamsin Moraven nearly trusted him — one of her unsent letters is addressed to him, and her last letter crosses him out. She never accuses him in writing. Knows enough to be dangerous; trades information for safe passage.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
