      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Olfard</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/olfard-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Olfard\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Olfard Trent, barkeep at the Coopered Wreck on the Hardby waterfront. Sixty, a one-eyed retired bosun; pretends not to listen and remembers everything. Will not fight, and will not talk about Tarsh.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
