      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Olo Crask</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/olo-crask-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Olo Crask\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Retired Aerdi marine captain hired to guard the recovery target. Stat block: MM Bandit Captain. Leads four Thugs (MM) <em>(six PCs: a fifth)</em>. Paid to hold the target and will fight to the last for it.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
