      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Reyna Worth</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/reyna-worth-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Reyna Worth\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Cindren-aligned overseer who runs a daily check at the third bell. Fifties, Aerdi expat, paid by the firm to notice things and to forget them in the right order.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
