      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Sarro Pell</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/sarro-pell-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Sarro Pell\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Widow housekeeper for Castrian Vell, eleven years' service. 'Notices everything.' In her sixties, Hardby-born, distantly related to Ostren Pell of Loftwick (no living connection).</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
