        "createdTime": null,
        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Solen Mereth</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/solen-mereth-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Solen Mereth\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>The compromised senior clerk of the Hardby branch. Late forties, Aerdi-born, and not corrupt by inclination — he took a quiet brief from a senior partner in 580 and has run it well for four years, which is a different thing and a worse one. Turns only under a procedurally clean evidence package, and hardens if pressed without one.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "BR2P3PoPgTamsinMora",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!BR2P3PortraitJr.BR2P3PoPgTamsinMora",
      "name": "Tamsin Moraven",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
