        "systemVersion": "5.3.0",
        "createdTime": null,
        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Tamsin Moraven</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/tamsin-moraven-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Tamsin Moraven\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>The missing woman whose disappearance triggers Phases 2 and 3. Mid-fifties, runs (ran) a counting house on Tannerway. Mother of Ailen, wife of Vellin. Her fate is the party's travel choice: recovered alive and altered on the two faster roads, murdered before they land on the slowest.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
