      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Vella Tannin</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/vella-tannin-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Vella Tannin\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Junior bond-officer at the C&amp;V Hardby branch. Carbon-copies the second set for the party and, in doing so, signs her own death warrant — they have twenty-four hours to get her out of Hardby. Recurs into Phases 4 and 5 only if extracted.</p>",
